title: kid_diallogues
---
Kid: HEY THERE SIR

-> why are you screaming
    Mc: why are you screaming
-> ……..
    Mc: ……..
-> HEY THERE KIDDO
    Mc: HEY THERE KIDDO

Kid: SIR I NEED SOMETHING FROM YOU SIR
Mc: …..
Kid: HERE TAKE THIS

// bunch of bugs and rocks 
<<giveItem bugs_and_rocks 1>>

Kid: I'D LIKE SOME AMETHYST SIR

-> this won't get you an amethyst
    Mc: this won't get you an amethyst
-> why
    Mc: why
-> …..
    Mc: …..

Kid: I'LL STOP BY TO TAKE IT LATER SIR THANN YOU
//  kid runs off lol

<<setFact quest_amethyst 1>>
===


title: Kid_Waiting
