title: Kid_Deliver
---
Kid: HELLO SIR
Kid: GOT THE AMETHYSTINE SIR?

-> Here you go
    Mc: Here you go
-> ….
    Mc: ….
-> yes but why'd a kid like you want one?
    Mc: yes but why'd a kid like you want one?

<<takeItem amethyst 1>>

Kid: I..
Kid: Thank you sir I
Mc: what?
Kid: it's my mom… she's sick and they told us we need an amethyst for her medicine
Kid: I will come here again with my mom to thank you SIR THANK YOUUU!!
// kid runs off+2

<<setFact quest_amethyst 2>>
